# MantrixFlow ELT flow (source → stage → transform → deliver)

Use this as the ground truth diagram whenever you touch the pipeline.

```
USER (apps/app)
  │  1. selects source connection
  │  2. enters source tables as `schema.table`
  │  3. writes one SQL SELECT per source table (dbt staging model)
  │  4. enters destination as `schema.table` (must already exist)
  │  5. clicks Run
  ▼
Go API  (apps/server/main-server)
  • validates JWT (Supabase)
  • decrypts source + destination credentials (Fernet AES-256)
  • builds RunConfig with:
      - selected_streams: SourceStreamConfig[]  (stream_key, repl_method,
        repl_key, duckdb_table_name=schema__table)
      - dbt_config.sql_models[].dest_table: schema.table
  • creates `pipeline_runs` row (status=pending)
  • enqueues pgmq `pipeline_jobs` / `incremental_sync`
  • returns HTTP 202 { run_id }
  ▼
Go Queue Worker  (apps/server/main-server)
  • polls pgmq every 5 s
  • MAX_CONCURRENT_RUNS gate
  • calls ELT /disk-status; requires available_gb ≥ plan_limit × 2
      └─ on shortfall: run status=waiting, re-queue with 30 s delay
  • dispatches POST /sync → Python ELT
  ▼
Python ELT  (apps/server/elt-server)
  PHASE 0 — PRE-FLIGHT  (runner/handlers/preflight_handler.py)
    • disk_guard.ensure_disk_budget
    • source table discovery (information_schema.tables)
    • destination table exists (gap 3)  ← fail hard, no CREATE
    • destination column match (gap 4)  ← fail hard, named column

  PHASE 1 — EXTRACT + STAGE  (runner/paths/duckdb_staged.py)
    • dlt reads from source
    • resources renamed so staged table is `raw.public__users` (gap 2)
    • incremental cursor restored from `last_state` if present (gap 5)
    • staged extraction follows the selected replication method

  PHASE 2 — DBT TRANSFORM  (runner/handlers/dbt_handler.py)
    • generates dbt project from dbt_config.sql_models (gap 6)
    • runs via dlt.dbt.package() on DuckDB
    • outputs live in DuckDB schema `analytics`
    • SKIPPED if user provided no sql_models

  PHASE 3 — DELIVER  (runner/handlers/delivery_handler.py)
    • for each sql_model output:
        - re-verify destination table exists  (gap 3)
        - re-verify columns match              (gap 4)
        - discover primary_keys
        - dlt write: Upsert against the existing destination table
    • never CREATE TABLE

  PHASE 4 — CLEANUP
    • state_handler.extract(pipeline) → checkpoint dict (gap 5)
    • os.remove(<run>.duckdb)  ← ALWAYS in finally
    • shutil.rmtree(<dbt project>)

  PHASE 5 — CALLBACK  (POST /internal/elt-callback)
    payload MUST include:
      status, rows_read, rows_written, duration_seconds, checkpoint,
      delivery_outputs[], staging_size_bytes, dbt_models_run,
      delivery_failures[], no_pk_warnings[]            (gap 9, 11, 12)
  ▼
Go Callback Handler  (apps/server/main-server/internal/server/callback.go)
  • updates pipeline_runs (status, rows, duration, run_metadata JSONB)
  • saves checkpoint to pipelines.checkpoint + last_sync_value
  • updates pipelines.last_run_status, last_run_at, counters
  • PublishStatus → Supabase Realtime
  ▼
USER sees live update in Run Status Drawer
  • 3-phase display (Extract+Stage / dbt Layer / Deliver)
  • delivered table pills (`analytics.hd`, …)
  • no-PK warning banner if `no_pk_warnings[]` is non-empty
```

## Directory map of authoritative pieces

- `apps/server/elt-server/runner/paths/duckdb_staged.py` — orchestrator
- `apps/server/elt-server/runner/handlers/` — per-phase handlers
  - `preflight_handler.py` (gaps 3, 4, 10)
  - `state_handler.py`     (gaps 2, 5)
  - `dbt_handler.py`       (gap 6)
  - `delivery_handler.py`  (gaps 3, 4, 12)
  - `disk_guard.py`        (gap 10)
  - `normalisation_handler.py`
- `apps/server/elt-server/api/routes/`
  - `sync.py`, `discover_table.py`, `validate_sql.py`, `disk_status.py`
- `apps/server/main-server/internal/server/`
  - `dispatch.go` + `dispatch_incremental.go` — build RunConfig, pre-flight
  - `staged_delivery.go` — disk guard + waiting-requeue helper
  - `pipeline_bundle.go` — `buildSourceStreamConfigs`,
    `buildStrictDBTSQLModels`, `duckdbTableName`
  - `callback.go` — persists delivery_outputs, staging_size_bytes,
    dbt_models_run, no_pk_warnings
- `apps/app/app/workspace/data-pipelines/[id]/builder/`
  - `panels/DestinationPanel.tsx` — schema.table dest input,
    `useDiscoverDestinationTable`, column pills, dest_match ✓/✗
  - `panels/RunStatusDrawer.tsx` — 3-phase display + no-PK banner
  - `shared/pipelineGraph.ts` — normalises graph → SourceStreamConfig[]
  - `store/pipelineStore.ts`

Do not introduce parallel code paths. Extend the pieces above.
